on in Japan</article-title><source>Health Policy</source><year>2003</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>119</fpage><lpage>27</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12849911</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0168-8510(02)00214-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bhan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Dave</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Verson</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhan</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhargave</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Goodwin</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk management strategies following analysis of cataract negligence claims</article-title><source>Eye</source><year>2005</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>264</fpage><lpage>268</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15286671</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.eye.6701493</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mazur</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence of the law on risk and informed consent</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2003</year><volume>327</volume><fpage>731</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14512484</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/bmj.327.7417.731</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>